# =============================================================================
# Secrets - never committed. See .env.example for the template.
# =============================================================================
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# The password-protected .env archive the rulebook (§9.2) requires to be
# committed *at submission* - ignored until then so an accidental `git add -A`
# can't publish the secrets early. On submission day, force-add it:
#     git add -f .env-tajne.zip
.env-tajne.zip

# Firebase service-account key (FCM sender credential). Contains a live RSA
# private key; it belongs in .env as FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_BASE64 and must
# never be committed as a file, whatever it gets renamed to.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
service-account*.json

# NOT ignored: UI/clinicnow_mobile/android/app/google-services.json. It is the
# *client* config, is compiled into the APK anyway, and the Android build fails
# without it - so a clean checkout has to carry it. A documented exception to
# "config only lives in .env" (rulebook Part II §C), not an oversight.

# =============================================================================
# Local agent/working documents - never pushed. These describe how the work is
# done (rules, status, plan), not the deliverable itself. README.md already
# states they are kept alongside the project rather than committed.
# =============================================================================
CLAUDE.md
GOALS.md
PLAN.md
TESTING.md

# =============================================================================
# .NET
# =============================================================================
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
publish/

# EF Core / ML.NET artifacts that must be regenerated, not committed
*.mdf
*.ldf
*model.zip

# =============================================================================
# Flutter / Dart
# (each UI/* app also has its own generated .gitignore for app-specific paths;
# these are repo-root-level catch-alls)
# =============================================================================
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/build/
**/android/**/gradle-wrapper.jar
**/android/.gradle
**/android/local.properties
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id

# =============================================================================
# Build/release artifacts - shipped via GitHub Releases, never committed
# (rulebook §9.2: "Build fajlovi se ne postavljaju u Git historiju")
# =============================================================================
*.apk
*.aab
fit-build-*.zip

# =============================================================================
# OS / editor noise
# =============================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
